    {
      "id": "claim_f9b3184fb4dd441dab6ba9dc20550dd4",
      "statement": "The adapter recognizes claim refusals by class name and swallows ClaimRefused for a reply, re-raising any other exception, so a refusal records nothing, wakes nothing and raises nothing while a real failure such as the durable write escapes _on_reply and handle_update to a poll loop whose narrow catch covers only TelegramAPIError and NotifyRejected, closing the runtime.",
      "evidence": [
