      "statement": "The reading envelope reports a reply as status answered (acknowledged once mark_processed sets processed_at) with response.choice null, response.text holding the owner's words and response.responded_via \"telegram-reply\", and that same envelope is what get_response, list_unprocessed, a call parked with wait_seconds and paraphe wait return, so the asking run learns the answer without any new transport.",
